WEBVTT

00:09:28.704 --> 00:09:31.996
And even if I fail, at least
I didn't fail to try.

00:09:32.621 --> 00:09:35.121
That's right. Yes. And I
have let me tell you,

00:09:35.371 --> 00:09:40.496
I have I have taken on a couple of things
in the last several years where

00:09:40.746 --> 00:09:41.746
I have just failed.

00:09:42.704 --> 00:09:45.704
But I don't regret it.

00:09:46.954 --> 00:09:51.454
I don't regret it. It's such a
great place to be and part of

00:09:51.454 --> 00:09:52.954
I guess part of what I've
been wondering is,

00:09:53.037 --> 00:09:56.579
as I've been applying applying
your work to my own life

00:09:56.579 --> 00:09:59.454
and also talking in class
about it quite a bit.